<aura:component>
    <!-- 
    what is salesforce lightning ?
        - earlier salesforce uses classic enviroment but now a days salesforce starts using lightning experience. to build any UI component inside the lightning exviroment that component will known as lightning web component.
        - the component which is build using the lightning framework can be re-used by other developers over the salesforce application.
    
    why use aura component programming model ?
        = salesforce aura component provide out of the box component.
        - salesforce aura component implement event-driven architecture.
        - also has a fast development.  
    
    salesforce lightning web component(LWC) and salesforce aura component comes under the salesforce lightning framework.

    Events
        - we need to write the handlers that respond to interface events as they occur.
        - there are 2 types of event in the framework.
            - application event
            - component - event
    
    lightning component 
        - build on top of aura
        - salesforce specifics extensions
    
    aura component 
        - open source framework

    aura lightning componet bundle 
        - client
            - component : here we write our markup code or design the view.
            - controller : its a javascript file(.js extension) that helps to implement the javascript logic. its is a client side controller helps to handle the event in the component.
            - helper : its a javascript file(.js extension) that helps to implement the javascript logic. this file contains JS functions that can ba called from any javascript code in a components bundle.
            - style : it is use to design the component.
            - Design : required for components used in lightning app builder or lightning app pages.
            - Documentation : description about your component.
            - SVG : custom icon resources for component
            - Renderer : it is also an js file used for rendering to override default rendering for a component.
        - server
            - apex controller
            - database

    -->
</aura:component>